#   NOT run on a device: no GL or Vulkan game was played with shaders from source.
# Shader chain: not touched (6c53446391cc; scripts/build-host.sh checks it).
# Apply with: patch -p1, to the tree out-stage/out-engine/engine + engine-patches/0401..0537, in the order of the numbers of this folder (scripts/build-host.sh does).
